urrentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z\"></path></svg>\n                        AC Performance Risks\n                    </h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-gray-700\">\n                        <li>Hilly dust leads to <b>rapidly blocked evaporator coils</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Fluctuating power causes <b>sudden PCB board burnouts</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Low refrigerant levels result in <b>high energy consumption</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Ignoring noises leads to <b>major fan motor failure</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Clogged filters reduce <b>indoor air quality</b> for family/guests.</li>\n                        <li>Untreated water leaks cause <b>damage to interior walls</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Skipping maintenance results in <b>poor cooling performance</b>.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- EXCLUSIVE SECTION: KEVADIYA, SOU, EKTA NAGAR -->\n    <section class=\"py-20 sou-section text-white relative\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10\">\n            <div class=\"bg-blue-900 bg-opacity-80 p-10 rounded-3xl border-2 border-yellow-400\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold mb-6 text-yellow-400 uppercase text-center\">Exclusive AC Support: Ekta Nagar &#038; Statue of Unity</h2>\n                <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center\">\n                    <div class=\"p-4\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 border-b-2 border-orange-500 pb-2\">Kevadiya Colony</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-blue-100\">Dedicated <b>ac maintenance</b> for residential quarters and staff colonies. We provide priority visiting for local government residences.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"p-4\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 border-b-2 border-orange-500 pb-2\">Statue of Unity Hub</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-blue-100\">Specialized <b>hvac repair services</b> for information centers, kiosks, and food courts around the SOU complex to ensure tourist comfort.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"p-4\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 border-b-2 border-orange-500 pb-2\">Ekta Nagar Hotels</h4>\n                        <p class=\"text-blue-100\">Comprehensive <b>chiller repair</b> and centralized AC support for Tent City, luxury resorts, and guest houses in the Ekta Nagar zone.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-10 text-center\">\n                    <p class=\"text-xl italic font-semibold text-yellow-300\">&#8220;Maintaining the world&#8217;s tallest cooling standards for the world&#8217;s tallest statue surroundings.&#8221;</p>\n                    <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" class=\"mt-6 inline-block bg-yellow-400 text-blue-900 px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-yellow-500 transition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book Emergency Visit in Ekta Nagar</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Rajpipla Product Section -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-yellow-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-4 text-blue-900\">Which Types of Products We Repair</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 mb-12\">Complete cooling maintenance for homes and the hospitality sector in Rajpipla &#038; Kevadiya.</p>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\">\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-x