uty <b>hvac maintenance</b> for the hospitality industry in Rajpipla.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">What brands of AC do you repair in Rajpipla?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We offer <b>multi-brand ac repair</b> for all leading names including LG, Samsung, Daikin, Blue Star, Voltas, Hitachi, and Carrier.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Is gas charging available for cassette ACs in Kevadiya?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we provide <b>ac gas charging</b> for all systems including cassette ACs and split units using R32, R410, and R22 refrigerants.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you offer repair for inverter PCB boards in Rajpipla?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Our technicians are experts in <b>inverter pcb repair</b>, ensuring your advanced cooling system is restored without a full board replacement.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">How long does a master AC service take?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">A comprehensive <b>ac jet wash service</b> usually takes between 45 to 90 minutes per unit to ensure peak performance.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you use original copper pipes for repairs?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we strictly use high-grade <b>genuine copper pipe for ac</b> to ensure maximum heat exchange and prevent gas leaks.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">What is the warranty on spare parts in Rajpipla?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We offer a <b>service warranty</b> on labor and a standard manufacturer-backed duration warranty on various <b>ac spare parts</b> replaced.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">How can I book an Atlas Aircon technician?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Booking is fast. Click the <b>WhatsApp button</b> on our banner or call our Rajpipla service desk at <b>+91 97272 57141</b>.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-blue-900 text-white py-12 border-t-4 border-yellow-400\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12\">\n            <div>\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/cropped-AtlasAircon-Logo.png\" alt=\"Atlas Aircon Rajpipla\" class=\"h-12 mb-6\" title=\"\">\n                <p class=\"text-yellow-100\">Professional <b>AC repair Rajpipla</b> and industrial cooling experts. Reliable service in the heart of Narmada district.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-6 text-yellow-400\">Rajpipla Helpline</h4>\n                <p class=\"mb-2\">Call: +91 97272 57141</p>\n                <p>Location: Rajpipla/Kevadiya, Gujarat</p>\n            </div>\n      